---
import InteriorLayout from '@/layouts/InteriorLayout.astro';
import { telegramQuoteLink } from '@/lib/quote-policy';
const projectTypes = [{value:'web',label:'Web & platforms',note:'Websites, SaaS, portals, and business tools'}, {value:'mobile',label:'Mobile application',note:'iOS, Android, or cross-platform'}, {value:'both',label:'Web + mobile',note:'A connected experience across devices'}, {value:'other',label:'Something different',note:'AI, automation, bots, indicators, or a new idea'}];
---
<InteriorLayout title="Project estimator — Hodges & Co. Studios" description="Give your idea a starting shape. Explore an initial software scope, technology approach, timeline, and a project brief for studio review with Hodges & Co. Studios.">
  <main id="main">
    <section class="interior-mast"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Project estimator / From possibility to plan</p><h1>A little clarity.<br /><em>A confident next step.</em></h1><p class="lede">Tell us what you want to build. Get an initial scope, a suggested approach, and a project brief we can review together on Telegram.</p><div class="mast-foot"><span>Three short steps · No commitment</span><span>Software / AI / Trading technology / Guided builds</span></div></div></section>
    <section class="wrap section-space estimate-layout"><aside class="estimate-rail"><ol class="estimate-steps" aria-label="Estimate progress"><li aria-current="step" data-progress="1"><b>01</b><span>You<small>Who we’re building with</small></span></li><li data-progress="2"><b>02</b><span>The idea<small>What you want to make</small></span></li><li data-progress="3"><b>03</b><span>The shape<small>Timeline and review</small></span></li></ol><p>Your brief starts the conversation. We review the requirements with you on Telegram before providing a tailored estimate. No automatic prices are published.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact">Prefer a conversation? ↗</a></aside>
    <div class="studio-form" id="estimator-panel">
      <noscript><p>This estimator needs JavaScript to move through the steps. <a href="/contact">Send us your idea directly</a> instead.</p></noscript><form id="estimateForm" novalidate>
        <section class="estimate-step" data-step="1" aria-labelledby="step-title-1"><p class="eyebrow">01 / A proper introduction</p><h2 id="step-title-1" tabindex="-1">Who’s behind the idea?</h2><p class="form-intro">Your contact details connect this scope to a conversation.</p><div class="field-grid"><div class="field"><label for="name">Your name *</label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required /></div><div class="field"><label for="email">Email address *</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required /></div></div><div class="field-grid"><div class="field"><label for="company">Organisation <small>(optional)</small></label><input id="company" name="company" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="200" /></div><div class="field"><label for="phone">Phone <small>(optional)</small></label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="40" /></div></div><p class="form-note">We use these details to prepare your scope and follow up about your project. Please keep passwords, credentials, and sensitive client information out of your brief. <a href="/privacy">How we use your information</a>.</p><div class="estimate-actions"><span></span><button type="button" class="button" data-next>Explore the idea ↗</button></div></section>
        <section class="estimate-step" data-step="2" hidden aria-labelledby="step-title-2"><p class="eyebrow">02 / The possibility</p><h2 id="step-title-2" tabindex="-1">What are we making?</h2><p class="form-intro">Think outcomes first. The technical choices can follow.</p><fieldset><legend>What kind of project? *</legend><div class="choice-grid">{projectTypes.map(type=><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="project_type" value={type.value} required /><span>{type.label}<small>{type.note}</small></span></label>)}</div></fieldset><div class="field"><label for="engagement">How would you like to build?</label><select id="engagement" name="engagement"><option>Build it for me</option><option>Build it with me — guided with AI coding tools</option><option>Help me choose an approach</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="project_description">Describe the idea *</label><textarea id="project_description" name="project_description" rows="6" minlength="40" maxlength="8000" required placeholder="Who will use it? What should they be able to do? Tell us the essential features, integrations, and anything already built."></textarea><small>At least 40 characters. For trading tools, include the platform, market, strategy rules, and risk controls.</small></div><div class="field"><label for="website_url">Existing website <small>(optional)</small></label><input id="website_url" name="website_url" type="url" placeholder="https://" maxlength="2000" /></div><div class="estimate-actions"><button type="button" class="button button-quiet" data-back>← Back</button><button type="button" class="button" data-next>Shape the project ↗</button></div></section>
        <section class="estimate-step" data-step="3" hidden aria-labelledby="step-title-3"><p class="eyebrow">03 / The practicalities</p><h2 id="step-title-3" tabindex="-1">Let’s find a sensible fit.</h2><p class="form-intro">These preferences guide the initial scope. We’ll refine the details together.</p><fieldset><legend>Your ideal timeline *</legend><div class="choice-grid">{[{value:'asap',label:'As soon as practical'},{value:'1-3 months',label:'1–3 months'},{value:'3-6 months',label:'3–6 months'},{value:'6+ months',label:'6+ months'}].map(item=><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="timeline_preference" value={item.value} required /><span>{item.label}</span></label>)}</div></fieldset><input type="hidden" name="budget_range" value="to-discuss" /><p class="form-note">Every project is different. We’ll discuss your requirements and budget privately on Telegram before providing an actual estimate.</p><div class="estimate-actions"><button type="button" class="button button-quiet" data-back>← Back</button><button type="submit" class="button">Create my project scope ↗</button></div></section>
      </form>
      <div id="estimate-loading" hidden role="status" aria-live="polite"><p class="eyebrow">Thinking it through</p><h2>Giving your idea<br />a starting shape.</h2><div class="loading-line" aria-hidden="true"></div><p class="form-intro">Preparing the approach, timeline, and a project brief for studio review. This may take a moment.</p></div>
      <section id="estimate-results" class="estimate-result" hidden aria-labelledby="result-title"><p class="eyebrow">Your initial project scope</p><h2 id="result-title" tabindex="-1">A starting point.<br />Room to refine.</h2><p>Your brief is ready. Copy its link, then paste it into our private Telegram conversation so we can analyse the requirements and provide a tailored estimate. Any suggested timeline or team remains subject to review.</p><div class="result-numbers"><div><span>Pricing</span><strong>After studio review</strong></div><div><span>Indicative timeline</span><strong id="result-timeline"></strong></div></div><div class="result-numbers"><div><span>Suggested team</span><strong id="result-team"></strong></div><div><span>Scope risk</span><strong id="result-risk"></strong></div></div><h3>The suggested approach</h3><p id="result-analysis"></p><h3>Potential technology</h3><div id="result-tech" class="tech-pills"></div><h3>What to explore next</h3><ul id="result-next"></ul><div id="share-proposal" hidden><h3>Keep the conversation moving.</h3><p>Save or share this project brief link with your collaborators. Anyone with the link can view it.</p><div class="field"><label for="proposal-url">Your project brief link</label><input id="proposal-url" type="url" readonly /></div><button class="button button-quiet" id="copy-proposal" type="button">Copy brief link</button> <a class="text-link" id="open-proposal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open proposal ↗</a></div><div class="estimate-actions"><button class="button button-quiet" id="new-estimate" type="button">Start again</button><button class="button button-quiet" id="download-estimate" type="button">Download PDF</button><button class="button button-quiet" id="print-estimate" type="button">Print / Save as PDF</button><a class="button" id="telegram-quote" href={telegramQuoteLink()} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discuss on Telegram ↗</a></div></section>
      <p class="form-status" id="estimate-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1"></p>
    </div></section>
  </main>
</InteriorLayout>
<script src="../scripts/project-estimator.ts"></script>
